Authors of Stow-Python.

Stow-Python is a Python reimplementation of GNU Stow and constitutes
derivative work of it.  The original GNU Stow was written and
maintained by:

  Bob Glickstein <bobg+stow@zanshin.com> (1993-1996)
      Original author of GNU Stow.

  Guillaume Morin <gmorin@gnu.org> (2000-2001)
      Maintainer.

  Kahlil Hodgson <kahlil.hodgson@dpi.vic.gov.au> (2007)
      Maintainer.

  Adam Spiers <stow@adamspiers.org> (2011-)
      Maintainer, together with the GNU Stow contributors.

The Python reimplementation was written by:

  Istvan Sarandi <prog@istvansarandi.com>
